      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#0 · the authored video-essay outline; the quilt's logos-health appointment (human-amplified: yes)",
          "title": "Information without nourishment",
          "italic": "The opening images demonstrate what the meal requires: a passage through received difference — the feed's interruptions keep attention occupied while the quieter discrepancy stays unarticulated.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The reader has finished the report: its contents can be recalled, repeated and discussed, and the next morning the account of the world proceeds much as before — something received without entering the conditions from which the reader judges and acts. The outline gives the interval a body: food has arrived, but the meal has not taken place. Before this meal hunger has to become perceptible: a stream of supplied answers arrives so continuously that the recipient has little opportunity to feel a question. The feed takes the place of seeking; its",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "interruptions keep attention occupied while the quieter discrepancy stays unarticulated — what is encountered and what the inherited account allows no longer fit together. Appetite gives that discrepancy a direction: what needs understanding, what has resisted explanation, what would count as an answer — felt urgency without a certified conclusion. Two failure images show the stakes: the display case preserves material behind glass to be catalogued untouched; the disposal takes material in and destroys its distinctions before they become consequential.\n\nOccurrences: the finished report (#0); the feed (#0, returned at #5→0's emptied rite); the display case and disposal (#0); the standing question (#0, #1).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
