      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#3–#4 · Symbolon Dynamics' native mechanism; A30; the Apportionment and Encounter/Countenance fields",
          "title": "The container; the shared table; companions are not food",
          "italic": "The table demonstrates reciprocal world-constitution: one participant's contribution becomes a condition of another's action without making its source mere material — assimilation reaches the receiving organisation itself.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "What has been chewed passes into a place where its first form can loosen: the stomach figures a bounded interior able to work on what it receives. The initial story can be taken apart so its components and dependencies are available for another account; more than changing the conclusion, the received material can change the criteria through which the next conclusion is reached — Symbolon Dynamics' native mechanism of image, interpreter and altered field. The container matters because dismantling an account removes supports the recipient has been acting through; patience means allowing the work time, without a rule that distress evidences truth. Circulation follows: an interpretation becomes a contribution another can meet. The table",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.42,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "receives distinct companions whose contributions change what the others can next ask; disagreement about the meal itself is included — a correction to a passage differs from a change in who can speak. The microbiome image names inherited frameworks and traditions assisting beyond solitary agency, with their biological claims kept to their own sources. Companions are not food: a table absorbing everyone's work into one authority performs the devouring relation the meal exists to transform; A29 requires resistance and cost to reach the office that can change the next action; A30 requires contributors to remain more than context. The absent-from-the-plate inquiry extends: who prepared the account, what was left out, who cannot appear under its terms.\n\nOccurrences: the criteria changed in processing (#3); the disagreeing table (#4); the microbiome image (#4); the non-food boundary (#4, against the black sun's capture in the taylor-images whole's field).",
          "x": 0.545,
          "y": 0.42,
          "width": 570,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
