      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · logos-health; the Symbol/Account/Trust and Arbitration fields; A29/A30/A35; A21",
          "title": "Satiety, rest, renewed hunger — and the emptied rite",
          "italic": "The meal returns-to its arguments with the whole movement intact: received determination examined, assimilated, shared and returned so the receiver and the conditions of future receiving can change.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The meal can finish. Satiety gives a measure of sufficiency: enough has been worked through to judge, act or live from changed ground — the recipient no longer merely carries the earlier account as an item. The distinction matters for individuation and recognition: integration increases the ability to bear differentiated relations; recognition makes source and history active; repeating a transformation's vocabulary leaves the identifying act untouched. Rest belongs to completion: the table need not become a machinery of compulsory intake. Then a new question arises from the nourished life: what follows, who else should be heard, what prepared next — renewed hunger carries the previous meal's consequence, different from",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "uninterrupted demand because something has been assimilated between the two appetites. The coda places bread in the hands of companions, invoking the Eucharist and loaves and fishes, then naming potlatch, seder, langar, iftar and thanksgiving as routes for further encounter — the loaves-and-fishes association remaining the outline's explicit wink, no derivation of 4+2. The coda also retains the emptied rite: the meal's form continuing after its capacity to bring people into changed relation has ceased — the morning information ritual. Logos-health names the integrity of the whole movement (human-amplified: yes for the ratified operation and its prescribed returns); demonstrating a therapeutic or institutional outcome would be another task.\n\nOccurrences: the satiety and rest (#5→0); the renewed hunger against the feed (#0, #5→0); the emptied rite (#5→0); the declared returns to A29/A30/A35 (#4, #5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
